584
00:25:37,327 --> 00:25:39,246
-Inside? You're right.
-Right?

585
00:25:39,746 --> 00:25:40,872
It's pretty stuffed.

586
00:25:40,956 --> 00:25:42,249
-There's a lot more inside.
-Yes.

587
00:25:42,332 --> 00:25:44,793
I wish it were bigger.

588
00:25:44,876 --> 00:25:46,711
BLUE BEING PLAYFUL

589
00:25:46,795 --> 00:25:48,046
