00:30:28,576 --> 00:30:31,204
THE DAY OF THE SCOUTING TRIP ON JIRISAN

670
00:30:35,083 --> 00:30:37,043
Gosh, this is so cool.

671
00:30:37,544 --> 00:30:39,420
It's like where immortal hermits hang out.

672
00:30:41,256 --> 00:30:47,846
THANKS TO THE INCREDIBLE SEA OF CLOUDS,
THE VIEW LOOKS LIKE A PIECE OF KOREAN ART

673
00:30:48,555 --> 00:30:50,723
We saw a sea of clouds on Hallasan.

674
00:30:50,807 --> 00:30:51,933
Right, on Hallasan.

675
00:30:52,016 --> 00:30:55,854
It was more moving since we could see it
