682
00:31:09,576 --> 00:31:11,202
"Thank goodness I'm not there."

683
00:31:14,873 --> 00:31:18,126
Like, "I'm so thankful
to be safe and warm in my room."

684
00:31:18,209 --> 00:31:19,878
Do they think, "They're so pitiful"?

685
00:31:20,461 --> 00:31:21,671
SO PITIFUL?

