00:32:24,192 --> 00:32:25,401
All right, time for a game.

701
00:32:26,861 --> 00:32:28,988
NATURALLY SITS DOWN

702
00:32:29,572 --> 00:32:31,616
Why did you sit?
Do you even know what we're doing?

703
00:32:31,699 --> 00:32:32,533
A game!

704
00:32:33,076 --> 00:32:34,160
I know!

705
00:32:34,243 --> 00:32:35,411
We're sitting on the floor?

706
00:32:35,495 --> 00:32:36,913
THE EARTH ARCADE FAN ALSO ENTERS

707
00:32:40,500 --> 00:32:41,626
I know!

708
00:32:42,752 --> 00:32:44,837
EPISODE 7'S ZZAN OF TAR
AND MR. KIM UI-HAN ENTER TOO

709
00:32:44,921 --> 00:32:46,923
-We're playing a game.
-Yeah, a game.

710
00:32:47,674 --> 00:32:50,051
First off, congratulations.

711
00:32:50,134 --> 00:32:51,552
It's the final shoot.

712
00:32:55,515 --> 00:32:58,059
But we have another piece of good news,

713
00:32:58,142 --> 00:33:00,853
so we asked to see you here.

714
00:33:01,437 --> 00:33:07,860
Once all of you finish hiking Jirisan
during tomorrow's shoot,

715
00:33:07,944 --> 00:33:11,572
