716
00:33:11,656 --> 00:33:13,950
We want to congratulate you on that first.

717
00:33:14,033 --> 00:33:15,410
SEORAKSAN, TAEBAEKSAN

718
00:33:15,493 --> 00:33:17,036
HALLASAN, YEONGNAM ALPS, JIRISAN

719
00:33:17,120 --> 00:33:19,706
Hiking 70 km isn't an easy feat at all.

720
00:33:19,789 --> 00:33:22,709
And when our series began,
we promised you something.

721
00:33:22,792 --> 00:33:24,043
If you reach 100 km…

722
00:33:24,127 --> 00:33:26,087
He said we could change the show.

723
00:33:27,964 --> 00:33:29,549
If you reach 100 km,

724
00:33:29,632 --> 00:33:33,219
we'll give you the right to change
the theme of our show as you like.

725
00:33:33,302 --> 00:33:35,388
IF THEY REACH 100 KM,
THEY CAN CHANGE THE SHOW

726
00:33:35,471 --> 00:33:37,640
For example, what do you want to do?

727
00:33:37,724 --> 00:33:41,686
I want to go on vacation with them.

728
00:33:41,769 --> 00:33:43,730
<i>Take a Vacation!</i>

729
00:33:44,313 --> 00:33:45,148
That'd be great.

730
00:33:45,231 --> 00:33:47,025
