1441
00:57:52,093 --> 00:57:53,094
Correct.

1442
00:57:53,178 --> 00:57:54,387
Doc…

1443
00:57:54,471 --> 00:57:55,930
-Martens.
-Correct.

1444
00:57:56,014 --> 00:57:57,182
-Monc…
-Ler.

1445
00:57:57,265 --> 00:57:58,141
Correct.

1446
00:57:58,224 --> 00:57:59,434
-Gentle…
-Monster.

1447
00:57:59,517 --> 00:58:00,560
Correct.

1448
00:58:00,643 --> 00:58:01,644
-Gior…
-Dano.

1449
00:58:01,728 --> 00:58:02,562
Correct.

1450
00:58:02,645 --> 00:58:03,688
-Chrome…
-Hearts.

1451
00:58:03,771 --> 00:58:04,689
Correct.

1452
00:58:04,772 --> 00:58:06,399
-Swar…
-Ovski.

1453
00:58:08,610 --> 00:58:09,611
We'll go home now!

1454
00:58:09,694 --> 00:58:10,570
SUCCESSFUL

1455
00:58:11,362 --> 00:58:13,573
THEY WON THE LAST 2 GAMES

1456
00:58:13,656 --> 00:58:14,699
We'll go home now!

1457
00:58:16,367 --> 00:58:20,580
THEY WIN ANOTHER 4 KM

1458
00:58:21,206 --> 00:58:23,374
My ex-girlfriend asked me to buy her that.

1459
00:58:25,293 --> 00:58:27,170
That's why I know.

1460
00:58:27,253 --> 00:58:28,463
"What? Swar what?"

1461
00:58:29,297 --> 00:58:30,673
"Swarovski!"

1462
00:58:30,757 --> 00:58:32,175
"What? Swarov?"

1463
00:58:32,258 --> 00:58:33,593
