1471
00:58:48,816 --> 00:58:51,194
-The Gwaneumsa team!
-Right, the Gwaneumsa team.

1472
00:58:52,695 --> 00:58:53,613
GWANEUMSA 99.5

1473
00:58:53,696 --> 00:58:55,156
